   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Quiet luxury: median ~121, cool-neutral shadows (26,31,25), neutral highlights (218,215,212), low-medium saturation (0.25), natural skin (hue 29). Best for: Elegant ballroom and estate weddings, classic bridal portraits, black-tie evenings, monochrome florals. Refined, never warm-cast; shadows stay clean.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
